VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'at all of these, well, you can plainly see, you&nbsp; know, the two Garmin options really aren\'t quite&nbsp;&nbsp; as clear as the rest of them. So, let me unfreeze&nbsp; the video and just kind of walk out another 10&nbsp;&nbsp; ft here. So, this is 20 ft out. And I\'m going to&nbsp; freeze it. And looking at this, you can still read&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[12:11] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the VFO options, the A119 and the 229 Plus. Those&nbsp; are, you know, you can, if you try, you can read&nbsp;&nbsp; those. Um, the Garmins really not so much. Um,&nbsp; taking a look at the Thinkware options. Honestly,&nbsp;&nbsp;'

