[12:53] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'up to that, you know, $200, $250 price point, the&nbsp; A229 and the Thinkware Arc 700, they are extremely&nbsp;&nbsp; close. And if I go out to 30 ft here, um I think&nbsp; the Thinkware is slightly cleaner on the license&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[13:07] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'plate than what the VFO is. It\'s pretty minor.&nbsp; You\'re going to have to go full screen to be&nbsp;&nbsp; able to see this, but I do see a slight edge on&nbsp; the Thinkware product here. So, what I\'m going&nbsp;&nbsp; to do now is the exact same test. So, I\'m going to&nbsp; walk out to 10 feet and freeze the video. And now&nbsp;&nbsp;'

