VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'you\'re going to be able to see, okay, some of&nbsp; these higher price point products, how do they&nbsp;&nbsp; compare to what we just looked at? So, down here&nbsp; on the bottom, this is going to be kind of the mid&nbsp;&nbsp; to high. This is the A229 Pro, the Ark 900 from&nbsp; Thinkware, and then up top I have the VFO 329S,&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[13:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
