VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'one that\'s the worst one on the screen is going&nbsp; to be a Garmin. Um, I don\'t believe the Garmin is&nbsp;&nbsp; even 4K. I think, you know, this thing\'s like 400&nbsp; bucks, this Garmin Live, and it\'s a 2K dash cam,&nbsp;&nbsp; which I\'m sure it\'ll work fine in a pinch. If you&nbsp; get an accident, yeah, it\'s still going to point&nbsp;&nbsp;'

