VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'out who\'s liable for it. But as far as picking out&nbsp; fine details, it would not be my first option. So&nbsp;&nbsp; when you go out to 30 feet, yeah, the the Garmin\'s&nbsp; pretty much out of the question. Um, honestly, the&nbsp;&nbsp; Vivo 229 Pro is honestly that\'s the best looking&nbsp; picture out of anything in this test so far. So,&nbsp;&nbsp;'

