[14:59] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'these. And I think from the higherend price point&nbsp; cameras, the worst one here is probably going to&nbsp;&nbsp; be the Thinkware RX700. um it\'s just not quite&nbsp; as clean as the VFO 229 Plus or the 229 Pro. And&nbsp;&nbsp;'

